Art in Motion, Singapore. A watch built to measure performance, reinterpreted as a room full of people.

92% of everyone who tapped completed the journey. 39% shared to social, unprompted. 80% of participants arrived on the one Saturday of the live activation. Credited by Casio as TapTech powered by DEPARTMNT on G-SHOCK Singapore’s own site.
